Subject: Accounting for bilateral symmetry in 3D GMM results in 2D graphics
Message-ID: <hvJrjPhNpLw.flbCA3mFAQAJ@geomorph-r-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/geomorph-r-package/c/hvJrjPhNpLw/m/flbCA3mFAQAJ>
