It appears that there is something wrong with your factors, probably from something that occurs when reading your data.  For each factor, you have 306 values but you also have 306 levels.  This means that every individual value has a unique level, which means you run out of degrees of freedom when you attempt to fit a linear model.  You could consider using droplevels, re-read your data with different parameters, attempt to fix the factor some other way, or reformat your csv file.  Regardless, you should have fewer levels than you do observations.

Hipe that helps.

Mike

