Hi Dean,

Thanks for your help on this. I've been trying to find out a way of including groups (i.e. population and developmental stage) into my PLS analyses - is there a better way of doing this other than by subsetting?

i.e. something similar to this from intergration.test but with the X as shape matrix and Y as matrix of variables:
 <https://rdrr.io/r/base/funprog.html> <https://rdrr.io/r/base/function.html> <https://rdrr.io/cran/geomorph/man/integration.test.html>
